 // 实现...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"safe-area-与屏幕适配\">Safe Area 与屏幕适配</h2><p>现代 iOS 设备有刘海屏（Dynamic Island）、底部虚拟按键区域；Android 设备有形态各异的状态栏和导航手势条。<code>react-native-safe-area-context</code> 是处理这些问题的标准方案：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"import { SafeAreaProvider, useSafeAreaInsets } from &#39;react-native-safe-area-context&#39;;&#10;&#10;// 在 App 根组件包裹 Provider&#10;function App() {&#10;  return (&#10;    &lt;SafeAreaProvider&gt;&#10;      &lt;NavigationContainer&gt;&#10;        &lt;RootNavigator /&gt;&#10;      &lt;/NavigationContainer&gt;&#10;    &lt;/SafeAreaProvider&gt;&#10;  );&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 在需要的组件中使用 Safe Area Insets&#10;function BottomTabBar() {&#10;  const insets = useSafeAreaInsets();&#10;&#10;  return (&#10;    &lt;View style={{ paddingBottom: insets.bottom }}&gt;&#10;      {/* 底部内容不会被 Home Indicator 遮挡 */}&#10;    &lt;/View&gt;&#10;  );&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { SafeAreaProvider, useSafeAreaInsets } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'react-native-safe-area-context'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 在 App 根组件包裹 Provider</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> App</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;